<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">

    <!--
        Material Design Icons (Apache-2.0, pictogrammers.com) — the general-purpose
        glyphs both Nimbus apps draw. Kept as StreamGeometry resources rather than an
        icon font: a font is one more asset to load, to trim-root, and to keep in step
        with a NativeAOT publish, and a Path is what PathIcon wants anyway.

        Membership rule: a glyph lives here once BOTH apps use it. A Kubernetes cube or
        a Postgres elephant stays in its own app's Theme.axaml — this file is the
        vocabulary they share, not a dumping ground for every icon either one owns.
        The first 26 were byte-identical in the two apps when this file was extracted;
        anything added since is a glyph one app owned and the other needed.
    -->

